 already ran. An agent must not run the program again to get past a refusal.
 
+## Workflow questions
+
+Open **Approvals** to answer a waiting workflow question. Questions can ask for
+free text, a choice, confirmation, a number, a date, or a fresh connection check.
+Saving a response lets the workflow continue; it does not confirm that an account
+or service has recovered. Reconnect first, then ask the workflow to verify it.
+
+A workflow can provide its own interactive display. **Use the standard form**
+keeps the same question answerable when that display is unavailable. Actions in a
+custom display still ask for tool permission when required. Declining a tool
+request does not answer the workflow question.
+
 ## What approval does not cover
 
